# Toy castle wall bay (ticket 27.7): one bay of the block castle's curtain wall, 5.2 m long (x), 2 m thick, its outer face towards +z, standing on y = 0 (60 times
# life size). Five courses of 1 m blocks, beech and cream in turn, laid in running bond (the top course is one plank, so the wall-walk is flat) with rounded edges
# that draw the joints. The wall-walk is the top, at 5 m, the lowest of the castle's floor heights (rings 5.3 m, see toy-castle0.sdf). Neighbouring bays
# meet end to end and run into the towers; the merlons are placed by the layout.
format 1
collider mesh
Detail detail=0.2
    Union
        # Course 0
        Material material=toy_beech
            Union
                Translate translation=(-1.3, 0.5, 0)
                    RoundBox size=(1.3, 0.5, 1) roundness=0.07
                Translate translation=(1.3, 0.5, 0)
                    RoundBox size=(1.3, 0.5, 1) roundness=0.07
